---
description: >-
  Sets tickInterval to 1day with excludes weekends, and via frontmatter
  config.gantt.topAxis: true renders the date axis labels at the top
  instead of the default bottom position.
config:
  gantt:
    topAxis: true
---
gantt
  title A Gantt Diagram
  dateFormat   YYYY-MM-DD
  axisFormat   %m-%d
  tickInterval 1day
  excludes     weekends

  section Section
  A task           : a1, 2022-10-01, 30d
  Another task     : after a1, 20d
  section Another
  Task in sec      : 2022-10-20, 12d
  another task     : 24d
